acques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"IGEvYF8zejVLGrY5rzYjbA","review_id":"sYBcs9_Sk7Kd61-OTzfd4g","date":"2019-01-15T20:06:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9468598365783691,"text_excerpt":"I've been here twice and have been wowed both times. Couvant is in the gorgeous new Eliza Jane hotel and the food is fantastic! Start with their crudités platter- it has the mist amazing green garlic aioli. I could just roll around in a tub of that sauce!!! The escargot were delicious as well. The frites are fabulous. Mussels as well! Duck confit on lentils was tasty, but a tiny bit salty for me. The Dauphine potatoes were divine. The bone marrow mashed potatoes were equally delicious. Seriously, everything that crossed my lips in this restaurant was amazing. Come here and check it out yourself! We enjoyed it so much, we inquired about hosting an event here in the future! Amazing ambiance..."},{"business_id":"IGEvYF8zejVLGrY5rzYjbA","review_id":"UIy18Nukx2tgB3-nc2jolg","date":"2018-09-18T02:54:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9433595538139343,"text_excerpt":"My meal at Couvant was SO delicious! I think we ordered almost everything on the menu tonight. Our waiter was very friendly and very attentive. He didn't miss a beat. Chef Brad came out and checked in to see how our meal was going. Some of our meal highlights included steak frites (filet mignon medium rare was perfectly cooked, melt in your mouth tender with an amazing sauce and mushrooms), mussels, steak tartare, foie gras, sole cooked in an amazing sauce topped with capers and croutons, and red fish. We also ordered one of every side dish and they were all amazing. The table loved the creamed spinach but my personal favorites were the potatoes au gratin (there's a more appropriate Frenc..."},{"business_id":"IGEvYF8zejVLGrY5rzYjbA","review_id":"vtPk8kc9h5mLmzdROTxb-Q","date":"2019-06-07T05:00:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9391618967056274,"text_excerpt":"I love this place! I ate here twice in 4 days during my visit to New Orleans. I was looking to take a break from all the same fried Cajun selections offered in the French quarter and stumbled across this French modern restaurant at the Eliza Jane hotel. So glad I did. The menu is simple,classy, and reasonably priced. I got the steak tartare which was very tasty, and the foie gras [it is banned in my home state :( ], which was probably best terrine hands down I've had...so good I'm drooling as I'm writing this review. I also ordered the ail de rai (skate) as recommended by the waiter and was so happy I did. It was my first time having skate so there's a trick to eating it that one of the c..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"IGEvYF8zejVLGrY5rzYjbA","photo_id":"1lsVJcrLfnWQKmGYwRLuFQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/1lsVJcrLfnWQKmGYwRLuFQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8959576487541199},{"business_id":"IGEvYF8zejVLGrY5rzYjbA","photo_id":"ORry89h26ysPYbdpBvw3Mg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ORry89h26ysPYbdpBvw3Mg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8796934485435486},{"business_id":"IGEvYF8zejVLGrY5rzYjbA","photo_id":"DcG2pTwaFQU9BKY_tY3grQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/DcG2pTwaFQU9BKY_tY3grQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8253980875015259},{"business_id":"IGEvYF8zejVLGrY5rzYjbA","photo_id":"DvItsCu0k0M2OqtjKDAWeA","label":"outside","i